*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for the accessibility checks with axe-core. Starting the browser,
...                 opening pages and logging in is done by the shared browser layer (browser_interactions.resource).
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/browser_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Find Accessibility Violations
    [Documentation]    Checks the open page with axe-core and returns the violations
    ...    (fields: id, impact, help, helpUrl, count, nodes).
    ${violations}    Run Axe
    RETURN    ${violations}

Write Accessibility Report
    [Documentation]    Writes the violations as an HTML report to results/accessibility/ and returns the path.
    [Arguments]    ${address}    ${violations}
    ${report}    Create Axe Report    ${violations}    ${address}    ${OUTPUT DIR}
    RETURN    ${report}

Read Current Address
    [Documentation]    Returns the address of the open page.
    ${address}    Get Url
    RETURN    ${address}
